<title>HONG KONG: HK's GE Capital Finance places HK$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>HK's GE Capital Finance places HK$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate certificate of deposit issue has been privately placed, said arranger DKB Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER    GE CAPITAL FINANCE LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT	HK$50 MLN COUPON     3MH+30BP  MATURITY  12.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRCD	ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH    01.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  --	  CALLS	ANNUAL*   PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p> LISTING     NONE	REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING	--	  SALE LMTS  CUSTOMARY TAX PROV  FREE&amp;CLR</p>
<p> NEG PLG     --	  CRS DEF    --	  FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   **	  GOV LAW    HONG KONG PAY DATE  12.MAY.97</p>
<p> ARRANGER   DKB ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE ISSUER'S HK$2.0 BLN CD PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		CLEARING THROUGH CMU</p>
<p>	     *FRCD CAN BE REDEEMED AT PAR ON ANY ANNIVERSARY OF</p>
<p>		THE DEPOSIT DATE BY GIVING NOT LESS THAN 30 DAYS</p>
<p>		IRREVOCABLE PRIOR WRITTEN NOTICE TO THE HOLDERS.</p>
<p>	    **THE ISSUER IS WHOLLY OWNED BY GENERAL ELECTRIC</p>
<p>		CAPITAL CORP, WHICH IN TURN IS WHOLLY OWNED BY</p>
<p>		GENERAL ELECTRIC COMPANY USA.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
